This directory contains training and evaluation scripts for CIFAR-100 using a ResNet-9 backbone. We provide both a conventional MAC baseline and a π² version.
Training_teacher.py
Trains a conventional ResNet-9 on CIFAR-100 (baseline/teacher).

pi_2_train.py
Trains a π² ResNet-9 (TEMP layers replacing MAC ops) on CIFAR-100.

pi_2_inf1.py
Runs inference/evaluation on a saved π² ResNet-9 checkpoint.
